@evtivity/v2g-exi

wasm/v2g_exi.wasm contains a WebAssembly build of libcbv2g v0.3.2
(https://github.com/EVerest/libcbv2g), the EXI codec for DIN 70121,
ISO 15118-2 and ISO 15118-20 messages generated by cbexigen.

