libcbv2g is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The license text
is in LICENSE-libcbv2g. The library source is not modified: the build script
(scripts/build-wasm.sh) downloads the v0.3.2 release archive, verifies its
SHA-256 checksum, and compiles it unchanged together with c/glue.c.

c/glue.c, src/ and scripts/ are part of EVtivity and licensed under the
Business Source License 1.1 like the rest of the repository.
